OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day although still
OL,6,Fwith a fair amount of cloud. There
OL,7,Fcould be the odd spot of rain near the
OL,8,Feast coast at first, while western
OL,9,Fcounties will see some more persistent
OL,10,Frain towards evening. Fresh
OL,11,Fsoutheasterly wind.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, becoming heavy at times and
OL,15,Faccompanied by strong southeasterly
OL,16,Fwinds. Western areas will turn drier
OL,17,Fand less windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
