OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA wet windy start in the east
OL,6,Fbefore drier conditions with lighter
OL,7,Fwinds gradually spread across from the
OL,8,Fwest.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,11,Fwith outbreaks of rain, becoming heavy
OL,12,Fat times and accompanied by strong
OL,13,Fsoutheasterly winds. Western areas
OL,14,Fwill turn drier and less windy later.
